{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/693ed41118225b055397b6ea7684cabb.poster.avif?t=1750704755\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/693ed41118225b055397b6ea7684cabb.webm?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/693ed41118225b055397b6ea7684cabb.mp4?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simultaneously control a sword-wielding robot and a gunslinging space frog in Shoulders of Giants, an explosively colourful sci-fi roguelike designed to put your teamwork to the test.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forces of Entropy are spreading chaos through the stars, corrupting living planets and urging on the heat death of the universe. Led by the psychic Owl, one scrappy team of space survivors are fighting to restore the balance. A mysterious mech! A sharpshooting amphibian! Together they must cut through waves of enemies and restore light and life to the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/c3c37b16b31dddda0417095bf33f69c7.webp?t=1750704755\" width=600 height=30 /></span>It\u2019s dangerous to go alone! Play solo, or team up with a friend, each taking control of either the frog or the robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/e52a783135593ce9372087febbf4f3f6.poster.avif?t=1750704755\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/e52a783135593ce9372087febbf4f3f6.webm?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/e52a783135593ce9372087febbf4f3f6.mp4?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/1771888a512bbf89f3b683fd39a1ab44.webp?t=1750704755\" width=600 height=30 /></span>Battle the forces of entropy in four-player online co-op. Is your teamwork strong enough to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/a70f1274a830d0915f92455a8dca5cf2.poster.avif?t=1750704755\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/a70f1274a830d0915f92455a8dca5cf2.webm?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/a70f1274a830d0915f92455a8dca5cf2.mp4?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/0162e3dfbc9abcff88030e20d90e58a4.webp?t=1750704755\" width=600 height=30 /></span>Experience quick bursts of roguelike joy, as you explore, grow, and become gloriously overpowered on a never ending ride of randomized levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/dd41a9bfde4dd3613caceede86b15c6a.poster.avif?t=1750704755\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/dd41a9bfde4dd3613caceede86b15c6a.webm?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/dd41a9bfde4dd3613caceede86b15c6a.mp4?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/135e3ffe987b7a2bb545a462dea1609d.webp?t=1750704755\" width=600 height=30 /></span>Shoot \u2018n\u2019 slash your way through explosively colourful planets, restoring life and light to the shattered worlds as you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/d670675610df0f58d84ccdfd0a0f4845.poster.avif?t=1750704755\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/d670675610df0f58d84ccdfd0a0f4845.webm?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/d670675610df0f58d84ccdfd0a0f4845.mp4?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/1e07783fb1359ee713a5559370117ca6.webp?t=1750704755\" width=600 height=30 /></span>From grappling hooks to glowing grenades, each new pickup can radically alter your power and playstyle. Mix and match abilities to create a moveset that\u2019s all your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/01810184bd3ac1ac0f13f33d37c8800a.poster.avif?t=1750704755\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/01810184bd3ac1ac0f13f33d37c8800a.webm?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283880/extras/01810184bd3ac1ac0f13f33d37c8800a.mp4?t=1750704755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"On the Shoulders of Giants","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283880/a20b28a420f0a475fb851eee07cbba00e39ae776.jpg"},{"name":"Frogbot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283880/3d1a1a62b03429a39b49acdda4b830989f4a8311.jpg"},{"name":"At Least We Have Each Other...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283880/82c7a946f50bef59420eda6c14825eb6f7d9f895.jpg"},{"name":"A Ribbiting Performance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283880/5c10320a20d44c8a6bff87e7411a33365876222c.jpg"},{"name":"Ouch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283880/b7eef29770782b41ba59605f6e77d95a6e2eff0a.jpg"},{"name":"Turn Up The HEAT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283880/8103fdba8cb46f43b26dcc4f888bc760c52fa0d8.jpg"},{"name":"Nothing to Wear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283880/6ecf7db0e2abbb707f6b5f6d36e2526b8f